{"id":852513,"title":"续写新篇 ：解读C++20/23核心新特性","content":"<p>你好，我是吴咏炜。</p><p>继 2022 年的课程迭代之后，时隔两年，我计划再一次对专栏内容进行续写。这两年间，C++ 在语言特性、标准库等方面都有很多重要的更新，我对 C++ 语言也有了一些新的理解和感悟，这些都值得讨论一下。</p><p>比如说：范围和视图已经与我们专栏里讲过的有所不同，在数据处理的便利性和效率上持续提升，能更灵活地操作容器数据；C++ 标准库有一系列的增强，既有表达上的改进，也有性能上的提升；契约式设计能够增强代码的健壮性，更便于维护；等等。</p><p>基于此，我决定在专栏已有内容的基础上，补充如下内容（以实际上线为准）：</p><ul>\n<li>\n<p>范围更新和视图</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>C++20 里的时间</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>std::format 和 std::print</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>契约式设计</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一些 C++20/23 的重要更新</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>静态反射更新和序列化</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p>如果你有更多想要了解的内容，也欢迎在留言区告诉我！</p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398783,"user_name":"Geek_9efcf3","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2052961,"ip_address":"湖南","ucode":"D91ACB363F4B3D","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eoNezZmaohkfTsxQ1Gr4qjxLM3wfjB9VBrU7AEfSPnicNCG47deoe8Um8n7Kl2DEZcNDEtzgD4dfHQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742223445,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144694,"content":"😇😎","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1645639,"ctime":1742370749,"ip_address":"上海","comment_id":398783,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100040501,"comment_content":"吴老师的课程真是太良心了，持续在更新","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1645639,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/1c/47/53c48284.jpg","nickname":"吴咏炜","note":"","ucode":"8C24C10AEC779F","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":658651,"discussion_content":"😇😎","content_length":2,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1742370749,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions"